{
  "id": "p04",
  "title": "The Island Party",
  "titleZh": "岛上的聚会",
  "topic": "相聚",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our small boat reaches the quiet island coast just before dark.",
        "zh": "我们的小船在入夜前抵达安静的岛屿海岸。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Above the gate, a winter flag moves slowly in the cold wind.",
        "zh": "门上方，一面冬日的旗子在冷风里慢慢飘动。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The venue is a small, warm flat near the quiet harbour.",
        "zh": "场地是安静港口附近一间小而暖的公寓。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The key turns by itself, and the old wooden door opens.",
        "zh": "钥匙自己转了一下，那扇旧木门就开了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My friend's wife plans a party for their tenth happy marriage year.",
        "zh": "我朋友的妻子为他们的第十个幸福婚姻年筹办一场聚会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Thirteen guests arrive with bags of fresh bread, cheese and fruit.",
        "zh": "十三位客人带着新鲜面包、奶酪和水果来了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Milk and sweet cake wait on a wide wooden table by the wall.",
        "zh": "牛奶和甜蛋糕摆在靠墙的一张宽木桌上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A kid runs past us with a small, excited brown dog.",
        "zh": "一个小孩带着一只兴奋的小棕狗从我们身边跑过。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A policeman at the front door makes a very polite excuse.",
        "zh": "前门的一位警察很客气地找了个借口。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Her warm voice says welcome, and every tired guest smiles back.",
        "zh": "她温暖的嗓音说着欢迎，每位疲倦的客人都回以微笑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "However, the old heater is still cold and rather weak tonight.",
        "zh": "然而，那台旧暖气今晚还是冷的，而且相当弱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Heavy coats hold the heat inside the small, crowded front room.",
        "zh": "厚外套把小而拥挤的前屋里的热气留住。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The guests dance with easy joy and loud, happy, open laughter.",
        "zh": "客人们带着轻松的喜悦和响亮、欢快的笑声跳舞。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The music has an easy beat that everyone follows with their hands.",
        "zh": "音乐有一种轻快的节拍，每个人都用手跟着打。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Children draw bright pictures in every colour they can possibly find.",
        "zh": "孩子们用他们能找到的每一种颜色画出明亮的图画。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A boy tries to catch a red ball near the bright fire.",
        "zh": "一个男孩在明亮的火边试着接住一个红球。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we send a short message: the last boat leaves tomorrow.",
        "zh": "然后我们发了一条简短的消息：最后一班船明天开。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The family has an agreement, and the simple policy is clear.",
        "zh": "这家人有一个约定，而那条简单的规矩很清楚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her concerned face shows that something is quite wrong tonight.",
        "zh": "她担忧的脸说明今晚有什么事情相当不对。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Although the wind is cold, we enjoy it with real delight.",
        "zh": "尽管风很冷，我们还是很享受它。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We step out to the side yard for a little cool air.",
        "zh": "我们走到侧院，想透一点凉气。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, since the last boat left, we must deal with this small problem.",
        "zh": "于是，既然最后一班船已经走了，我们必须处理这个小问题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A loose box may fall, so we save the cake and the cups.",
        "zh": "一个松动的箱子可能会倒，所以我们保住蛋糕和杯子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The guest whom we encourage tries the old song again.",
        "zh": "我们鼓励的那位客人又试了一遍那首老歌。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mind cannot really imagine an eighth birthday without her here.",
        "zh": "我实在无法想象没有她在这里的第八个生日。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small tool and an old photo mark the day of his birth.",
        "zh": "一把小工具和一张旧照片标记着他出生的那天。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later an angry guest drops a golden cup on the hard floor.",
        "zh": "后来，一位生气的客人把一只金杯掉在硬地板上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My stomach turns, but I stay braver than I was before.",
        "zh": "我胃里一阵翻腾，但我比从前更勇敢。"
      }
    ]
  ],
